-size:16px\">宁夏泽宁项目管理有限公司</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">（招标代理机构）受招标人委托负责本工程的招标事宜。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:32px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:33px\"><strong><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">2.</span></strong><strong><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">项目概况与招标范围</span></strong></p><p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:32px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:33px\"><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">2.1 </span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">项目概况：海原县人民广场大转盘路口重新渠划，施划热熔标线</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">980平方米。建设满屏机动车信号灯7套，左转信号灯5套，倒计时显示器7套，人行横道信号灯10套，交通信号机1套，雷达视频车检器7套，建设信号灯杆6套，人行灯杆10套。建设1200W电警抓拍单元7套，1200W卡口抓拍单元9套，环保频闪灯17套，环保多合一补光灯18套，道路管理终端1套，红绿灯信号检测器1套，建设电警杆7套。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:32px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:33px\"><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">2.2 </span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">建</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">设地点：</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">海原县人民广场大转盘</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:32px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:33px\"><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">2.3 </span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">计划工期：</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">30日历日天。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:32px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:33px\"><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">2.4 </span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">招标范围：招标文件、施工图纸及工程量清单范围内所要求的所有内容</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:32px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:33px\"><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">2.5 </span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">标段划分：</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">本项目共分为一个标段。</span></p><h3 style=\"margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:32px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:33px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px\">投标人资格要求</span></strong></h3><p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:32px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:33px\"><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">3.1 </span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">投标人具备独立法人资格，</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">须具备</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">市政公用工程</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">施工总承包</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">三</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">级（含三</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">级）</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">以上资质，并在人员、设备、资金等方面具有相应的施工能力，其中，投标人拟派项目经理须具备</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">市政公用工程</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">专业</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">二级（含二级）以上（注册建造师执业资格），具备有效的安全生产考核合格证书，且未担任其他在施建设工程项目的项目经理。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:32px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:33px\"><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">3.2 </span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">本次招标不接受（接受或不接受）联合体投标。联合体投标的，应满足下列要求：</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">/</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">（接受联合体投标时填写）。</span></p><h3 style=\"margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:32px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:33px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px\">4.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px\">招标文件的获取</span></strong></h3><p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:32px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:33px\"><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">4.1 凡有意参加投标者，请于</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">202</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">6</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">-</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">7-1 1</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">8:00至202</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">6-7-8 23</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">:</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">59</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\">（北京时间，</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-